   583	const char* const kDlpackDoc = R"doc(Export this tensor zero-copy as a DLPack capsule (Python array API protocol).
   584	
   585	stream: the CONSUMER's CUDA stream, as a DLPack int. TensorCUDA queues all of its
   586	  work on the legacy default stream.
   587	  * None or 1: the consumer is on the legacy default stream; nothing to do.
   588	  * -1: no synchronization.
   589	  * 2 (per-thread default stream) or any other handle (a cudaStream_t): TensorCUDA
   590	    records a CUDA event on the legacy default stream and makes the consumer's
   591	    stream wait on it before returning, so the consumer sees every TensorCUDA
   592	    write queued so far.
   593	  * 0 is ambiguous under the protocol and raises ValueError.
   594	max_version: None (or major < 1) returns a legacy "dltensor" capsule; (1, x) or
   595	  later returns "dltensor_versioned" (DLPack 1.3 header, flags 0).
   596	dl_device: None or (2, this tensor's device); anything else raises BufferError.
   597	copy: None or False. copy=True raises BufferError (TensorCUDA never copies on
   598	  export).
   599	
   600	The capsule's manager holds a reference to the tensor's Storage, so the memory
   601	outlives this Tensor's last Python reference. data + byte_offset addresses
   602	element 0; strides are C-contiguous. An unconsumed capsule releases its
   603	reference when it is garbage collected.
   604	
   605	Raises BufferError for CPU tensors.
   606	
   607	External in-place writes (mark_modified rule): TensorCUDA's derived-tensor
   608	caches key on the Storage revision, which only TensorCUDA's own in-place ops
   609	bump. After anything outside TensorCUDA (a DLPack consumer, or a kernel given
   610	data_ptr()) writes into this tensor's memory, call t.mark_modified() before
   611	passing t (or any tensor sharing its Storage) to a TensorCUDA op. Today the
   612	only revision-keyed cache is terrain_render's density_filter cache on the
   613	materials tensor; ops that read device memory directly (arithmetic, matmul,
   614	norms, attention) need nothing. Calling mark_modified() when it is not needed
   615	is harmless.)doc";
